Security Critical: No
Shipped: yes

Description:
    compute shader decode etc to rgba.

Update instructions:
Change the commit in crowbar.txtpb (both the upstream identifier and the
git artifact) and the Revision above to the new upstream commit, then run
from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
If the generated shaders change, run
scripts/run_code_generation.py -g "Vulkan internal shader programs".

Local Modifications:
    src/etc_decoder.h is upstream's assets/shaders/decode/etc2.comp
    with "#version 450" removed (copy.bara.sky) and
    patches/0001-adapt-for-angle.patch applied:
    change main function name to DecodeRGB.
    add punchthrough parameter for DecodeRGB.
    add R11 macro for EAC_R11 decode.
    rename ALPHA_BITS to alphaBits.
